DESCRIPTION:Suzanne Lambert is a DC-based comedian\, internet personality\,
  and general menace. Known as “the Regina George liberal\,” she deliver
 s engaging and biting wit to an audience of over one million fans across Ti
 kTok and Instagram ([handle removed]).\n\nHer style could best be described
  as quick\, sharp\, amused bewilderment\; she pairs strangely strong opinio
 ns about inconsequential topics with beauty tips and hot political takes. O
 riginally hailing from Georgia\, she had a very normal upbringing in a gun-
 loving Bible Belt town and remains unaffected to this day.\n\nShe began per
 forming comedy in 2018 after her ex-boyfriend told her he would dump her if
  she tried it\; a true win-win scenario! She has performed at nationally ac
 claimed venues like the DC Improv\, Laughing Skull\, Arlington Drafthouse\,
  Side Splitters and the legendary Friars Club. Suzanne has performed with n
 ational acts like Mark Normand\, Katherine Blanford and Tony Woods.\n\nCoup
 les Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($
 45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the 
